{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>ואנשי</b> (and the men of) — four verse-initials: דיון ואידך ואנשי תמיד בדילו · ואנשי סדום · ואנשי בבל עשו את סוכות. For the men of Sodom served idolatry, as written, עשו את סוכות; but you shall be men of holiness to Me, and you shall continually separate impurity from among you, as written, ואנשי תמיד יבדילו." "<b>תשליכון אותו</b> — extra נ (nun) to teach that the carcass is removed 50 cubits from the city." "<b>לכלב תשליכון אותו</b> — adjacent to it: לא תשא שמע שוא. Hear: whoever speaks lashon hara is fit to be thrown to the dogs."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {0 "The notarikon of four ד״רפ״ס expands to four phrases each beginning ואנשי; the first element דין ואידך is rendered literally as 'judgment and the other' — the structure is terse and possibly elliptical.", 1 "He reads the nun of תשליכון as supernumerary against the expected form without final nun."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:11.689716627Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}